<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hi" class="scroll-smooth">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Portfolio - Uday Choudhary</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-950 text-gray-100 font-sans">

    <!-- Header & Navigation Menu -->
    <header class="sticky top-0 z-50 bg-slate-950/80 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-slate-900 py-4 px-6">
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto flex justify-between items-center">
            <h1 class="text-xl font-bold text-indigo-400">Portfolio</h1>
            <nav class="flex gap-4 sm:gap-6 text-sm font-medium">
                <a href="#skills" class="text-gray-300 hover:text-indigo-400 transition">Skills</a>
                <a href="#projects" class="text-gray-300 hover:text-indigo-400 transition">Projects</a>
                <a href="#creative" class="text-gray-300 hover:text-indigo-400 transition">Creative</a>
                <a href="#contact" class="text-gray-300 hover:text-indigo-400 transition">Contact</a>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 text-center">
        <div class="inline-block bg-indigo-950/50 border border-indigo-800/50 text-indigo-300 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-sm mb-6">
            WELCOME TO MY SPACE
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold mb-6 leading-tight">
            Hi, I am a <span class="text-indigo-400">Creator &</span> <br><span class="text-indigo-400">Developer</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-lg md:text-xl max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10 leading-relaxed">
            Main apne ideas ko digital world mein badalta hoon. Yeh meri personal website hai jahan aap mere baare mein aur mere kaam ke baare mein jaan sakte hain.
        </p>
        <div class="flex justify-center gap-4">
            <a href="#projects" class="bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 text-white font-medium px-6 py-3 rounded-xl transition shadow-lg shadow-indigo-600/30">View Projects</a>
            <a href="#contact" class="bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-800 text-gray-300 font-medium px-6 py-3 rounded-xl transition">Get in Touch</a>
        </div>
    </main>

    <!-- My Skills Section -->
    <section id="skills" class="py-16 px-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-12 text-center">My Skills & Expertise</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
            <!-- Frontend Card -->
            <div class="bg-slate-900/50 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-xl hover:border-indigo-500/50 transition">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-indigo-400 mb-2">Frontend Development</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-4">Modern user interfaces aur responsive layouts banana.</p>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                    <span class="bg-indigo-950/80 border border-indigo-800/50 text-indigo-300 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium">HTML5</span>
                    <span class="bg-indigo-950/80 border border-indigo-800/50 text-indigo-300 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium">CSS3</span>
                    <span class="bg-indigo-950/80 border border-indigo-800/50 text-indigo-300 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium">JavaScript</span>
                    <span class="bg-indigo-950/80 border border-indigo-800/50 text-indigo-300 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium">Tailwind CSS</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- Development Card -->
            <div class="bg-slate-900/50 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-xl hover:border-indigo-500/50 transition">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-indigo-400 mb-2">Development & Code</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-4">Programming aur version control management.</p>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                    <span class="bg-indigo-950/80 border border-indigo-800/50 text-indigo-300 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium">Python</span>
                    <span class="bg-indigo-950/80 border border-indigo-800/50 text-indigo-300 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium">Git & GitHub</span>
                    <span class="bg-indigo-950/80 border border-indigo-800/50 text-indigo-300 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium">API Integration</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- Tools Card -->
            <div class="bg-slate-900/50 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-xl hover:border-indigo-500/50 transition">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-indigo-400 mb-2">Tools & Cloud</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-4">Development environments aur cloud platforms.</p>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                    <span class="bg-indigo-950/80 border border-indigo-800/50 text-indigo-300 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium">VS Code</span>
                    <span class="bg-indigo-950/80 border border-indigo-800/50 text-indigo-300 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium">Google Cloud</span>
                    <span class="bg-indigo-950/80 border border-indigo-800/50 text-indigo-300 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium">GitHub Pages</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- Creative Card -->
            <div class="bg-slate-900/50 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-xl hover:border-indigo-500/50 transition">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-indigo-400 mb-2">Creative Writing</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-4">Content creation aur lyrical composition.</p>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                    <span class="bg-indigo-950/80 border border-indigo-800/50 text-indigo-300 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium">Hindi Rap Lyrics</span>
                    <span class="bg-indigo-950/80 border border-indigo-800/50 text-indigo-300 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium">Song Themes</span>
                    <span class="bg-indigo-950/80 border border-indigo-800/50 text-indigo-300 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium">Transcription</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Featured Projects Section -->
    <section id="projects" class="py-16 px-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-12 text-center">Featured Projects</h2>
        <div class="space-y-6">
            <div class="bg-slate-900/50 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-xl">
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Portfolio Website</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-400 mb-4 leading-relaxed">Ek responsive personal portfolio website jo modern design aur clean Tailwind layout ke sath banayi gayi hai.</p>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4">
                    <span class="inline-block bg-indigo-950/80 border border-indigo-800 text-indigo-300 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm">HTML / Tailwind CSS</span>
                    <a href="https://github.com/uc589677" target="_blank" class="text-indigo-400 hover:underline text-sm font-medium">View Code &rarr;</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-slate-900/50 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-xl">
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Creative Web Space</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-400 mb-4 leading-relaxed">Smooth navigation aur dark theme ke sath digital creative content aur projects ka showcase.</p>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4">
                    <span class="inline-block bg-indigo-950/80 border border-indigo-800 text-indigo-300 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm">JavaScript / UI Design</span>
                    <a href="https://github.com/uc589677" target="_blank" class="text-indigo-400 hover:underline text-sm font-medium">View Code &rarr;</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Creative & Songwriting Section -->
    <section id="creative" class="py-16 px-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-950/40 to-slate-900/50 border border-indigo-800/40 rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-xl backdrop-blur-md">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-4">🎤 Creative & Songwriting</h2>
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
                Coding ke alawa mujhe Hindi aur Hinglish mein romantic rap lyrics aur song themes likhna pasand hai. Apne vicharon ko shabdon aur music ke roop mein dhalna mera ek bada passion hai.
            </p>
            <div class="bg-slate-800/50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-700/60 text-indigo-200 italic">
                "Alfaazon ka safar aur sangeet ka junoon, digital world ke sath yeh meri alag pehchan hai."
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Contact Section -->
    <section id="contact" class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 text-center">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Get in Touch</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-400 mb-8">Aap mujhse contact karne ke liye niche diye gaye email par click kar sakte hain:</p>
        <a href="mailto:uc589677@gmail.com" class="text-indigo-400 hover:underline text-lg font-medium">uc589677@gmail.com</a>
    </section>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="bg-slate-950 py-8 border-t border-slate-900 text-center text-gray-500 text-sm">
        <p>&copy; 2026 Uday Choudhary. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
